{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pyrotoad is a puzzle-action precision platformer where you take on the role of Pyrotoad, a fiery frog with the enigmatic power to spew flames after chomping down fireflies. His mission? To reclaim his stolen sunglasses in an epic, hazard-filled quest.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/extras/be826180490c4a6fe486b298091dfc6b.poster.avif?t=1757209761\" width=1048 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/extras/be826180490c4a6fe486b298091dfc6b.webm?t=1757209761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/extras/be826180490c4a6fe486b298091dfc6b.mp4?t=1757209761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Leap, shoot, and puzzle your way through 35 challenging stages (12 in demo) across 10 diverse biomes (4 in demo), such as the regal halls of Webloch Castle, the fiery furnaces of Embercoat Factory, and the haunted Willowisp Woods. Along the way, unlock powerful abilities like double-jumping, wall-jumping, mid-air dashing, and more to outwit traps and overcome deadly obstacles.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty ramps up as you advance, putting even seasoned players to the test. Thankfully, most stages include checkpoints, and with the built-in password system, you can always pause your journey and return later. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, do you have what it takes to master the flames and help Pyrotoad reclaim his shades? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 levels of <strong>incremental challenge</strong>! (12 in demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 <strong>diverse biomes</strong>! (3 in demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack of 20+\u00a0<strong>8-bit Chiptunes</strong>! (in full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65 different\u00a0<strong>8-bit sound effects</strong>!\u00a0(in full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming story with <strong>cutscenes</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful and interesting <strong>abilities</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorials</strong> to help learn mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of <strong>obstacles</strong> and <strong>enemies</strong> to leap over and torch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in <strong>checkpoint system</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic style <strong>password system</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic retro handheld gaming experience! This game runs on a <i>real</i> <strong>Game Boy Color</strong>!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002180?t=1757209761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/7774ba8626e817878828af9ea7a87f5dab6762b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757209761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/e3924edff862d691c19b29de8a7489d0e1f7bae5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757209761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/e3924edff862d691c19b29de8a7489d0e1f7bae5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757209761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pyrotoad is a puzzle-action precision platformer where you take on the role of Pyrotoad, a fiery frog with the enigmatic power to spew flames after chomping down fireflies. His mission? To reclaim his stolen sunglasses in an epic, hazard-filled quest.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/extras/be826180490c4a6fe486b298091dfc6b.poster.avif?t=1757209761\" width=1048 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/extras/be826180490c4a6fe486b298091dfc6b.webm?t=1757209761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/extras/be826180490c4a6fe486b298091dfc6b.mp4?t=1757209761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Leap, shoot, and puzzle your way through 35 challenging stages (12 in demo) across 10 diverse biomes (4 in demo), such as the regal halls of Webloch Castle, the fiery furnaces of Embercoat Factory, and the haunted Willowisp Woods. Along the way, unlock powerful abilities like double-jumping, wall-jumping, mid-air dashing, and more to outwit traps and overcome deadly obstacles.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty ramps up as you advance, putting even seasoned players to the test. Thankfully, most stages include checkpoints, and with the built-in password system, you can always pause your journey and return later. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, do you have what it takes to master the flames and help Pyrotoad reclaim his shades? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 levels of <strong>incremental challenge</strong>! (12 in demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 <strong>diverse biomes</strong>! (3 in demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack of 20+\u00a0<strong>8-bit Chiptunes</strong>! (in full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65 different\u00a0<strong>8-bit sound effects</strong>!\u00a0(in full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming story with <strong>cutscenes</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful and interesting <strong>abilities</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorials</strong> to help learn mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of <strong>obstacles</strong> and <strong>enemies</strong> to leap over and torch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in <strong>checkpoint system</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic style <strong>password system</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic retro handheld gaming experience! This game runs on a <i>real</i> <strong>Game Boy Color</strong>!</p></li></ul>","developers":["WAV Games","Jonny Manjiro"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3984130","name":"Pyrotoad"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002180/b5951be6111bf0a3c074202f265cd3e7c9c34dbf/header.jpg?t=1757209761","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191651,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191651/movie480.mp4?t=1757191757","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191651/movie_max.mp4?t=1757191757"},"name":"Pyrotoad Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191651/02b6648d2c3ba0c5f3095b67669a892c2a58649f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757191757","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191651/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757191757","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191651/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757191757"}}],"name":"Pyrotoad Demo","package_groups":